MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Richard Kaysen, and City Council
FROM:

Sara Vasquez, Asst. Director of Purchasing
DATE:

February 3, 2015
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #R-20-15, for furnishing Loose Equipment for the new
Triple Combination Pumper Truck for the City of Cheyenne Fire Department.
______________________________________________
We had three (3) bidders respond to this bid, and the bid tab is below.

Bidder
Total Price
Front range Fire Apparatus
Frederick, CO
$45,667.32
L.N. Curtis & Sons
Salt Lake City, UT
$33,988.50
(did not bid all equipment)
Max Fire Apparatus
Castle Rock, CO
$33,763.47
(did not bid all equipment)

The bid was based on a total bid, not line item therefore, we cannot accept the other bids.

The bids were reviewed by Chief Martin, and John Fitzgerald, and their recommendation is to
accept the low bid from Front Range Fire Apparatus, Frederick, CO for a total amount of
$45,667.32.

Funding:
011-21-2111-42-86901  (SLIB)
